    a "Oh..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:85
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_def0ad19:

#   mc "What is it?"
    mc "O que é?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:87
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_186faaa1:

#   a "I um... I have this social phobia whenever I go to places I've never been to before."
    a "Eu... eu tenho fobia social sempre que vou a lugares onde nunca estive antes."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:91
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_d0f07040:

#   mc "Since when? I've never known this to be a problem for you before."
    mc "Desde quando? Nunca soube que isso fosse um problema para você antes."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:93
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_ee221cc9:

#   a "It's a more recent thing. It's kinda hard to explain."
    a "É algo mais recente. É meio difícil de explicar."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:95
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_c5608656:

#   a "And you're right, I never used to be like this."
    a "E você tem razão, eu nunca fui assim."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:97
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_93cfdc3f:

#   mc "When do you think it all started?"
    mc "Quando você acha que tudo começou?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:99
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_f9a58fd0:

#   a "Ever since I finished high school. And because I don't go to college, I don't really interact with anyone except for you guys."
    a "Desde que terminei o ensino médio. E como não frequento a faculdade, não interajo muito com ninguém além de vocês."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:101
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_aaa00930:

#   a "I'm fine at work because I'm usually in the back at my desk and I don't have to interact with anyone."
    a "Eu me dou bem no trabalho porque geralmente fico no fundo, na minha mesa, e não preciso interagir com ninguém."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:103
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_a8eb4e4c:

#   a "I mean, there are other places in town I'm okay being at."
    a "Quer dizer, existem outros lugares na cidade onde eu me sentiria bem."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:105
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_4c9e522e:

#   a "You must think I'm crazy, huh?"
    a "Você deve achar que eu sou louco, né?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:107
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_4f671c67:

#   mc "No, not at all."
    mc "Não, de forma alguma."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:109
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_77b1c807:

#   mc "We all have our own fears, our own anxieties..."
    mc "Todos nós temos nossos próprios medos, nossas próprias ansiedades..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:110
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_a7c21024:

#   mc "We can go somewhere else if you want?"
    mc "Podemos ir a outro lugar, se você quiser?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:112
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_006c5c84:

#   a "No, no... I don't want to put you out."
    a "Não, não... Não quero te incomodar."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:114
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_ffd988de:

#   a "I'm just warning you that I might be awkward once we're in there."
    a "Só estou te avisando que posso ficar meio sem jeito quando estivermos lá dentro."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:118
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_12e24907:

#   mc "In that case, let me order for you and talk to the waiter or waitress."
    mc "Nesse caso, deixe-me fazer o pedido para você e falar com o garçom ou a garçonete."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:120
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_67e82d10:

#   mc "Let's talk more when we're inside and at a table."
    mc "Vamos conversar mais quando estivermos lá dentro, sentados à mesa."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:123
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_c0e1e71e:

#   mc "(I may have to help [a_name] in public places, so she can get used to being around other people again...)"
    mc "(Talvez eu tenha que ajudar) [a_name] em locais públicos, para que ela possa se acostumar a estar perto de outras pessoas novamente...)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:144
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_1ab146ae:

#   barista "Hey guys, what can I get for you?"
    barista "Olá pessoal, o que posso trazer para vocês?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:146
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_48b280f8:

#   mc "I'll have an espresso with a lemon twist."
    mc "Vou querer um café expresso com uma rodela de limão."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:148
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_03e33b4b:

#   mc "And you, [a_name]?"
    mc "E você, [a_name]?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:151
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_75b093cf:

#   mc "Um... She'll have an Iced Latte?"
    mc "Hum... Ela vai querer um café com leite gelado?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:154
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_701fcf3a:

#   barista "Very good."
    barista "Muito bom."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:155
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_3854d25c:

#   barista "Take a seat guys, and I'll have someone bring those out to you when they're ready."
    barista "Sentem-se, pessoal, e eu pedirei que alguém traga isso para vocês quando estiver pronto."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:167
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_077e86bd:

#   a "Thanks for ordering for me."
    a "Obrigado por fazer o pedido para mim."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:169
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_cdbbba09:

#   a "How did you know that I wanted an Iced Latte?"
    a "Como você sabia que eu queria um Iced Latte?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:171
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_ffd512c1:

#   mc "You forget that I can be very observant."
    mc "Você se esquece de que eu posso ser muito observadora."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:173
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_a01b5d54:

#   mc "I've seen you drinking them when you're in the van or in your room."
    mc "Eu já vi você bebendo isso quando está na van ou no seu quarto."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:178
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_56e5f643:

#   mc "So while we're waiting for our orders, tell me what worries you the most about being out in public?"
    mc "Enquanto esperamos nossos pedidos, me diga, o que mais te preocupa em estar em público?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:180
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_75ae262a:

#   a "Oh, well... I guess my biggest fear is being judged, or getting embarrassed if I do or say something wrong."
    a "Ah, bem... Acho que meu maior medo é ser julgada ou passar vergonha se eu fizer ou disser algo errado."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:182
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_461d6430:

#   a "When I'm in front of a computer or I have a set of headphones on, I'm perfectly calm."
    a "Quando estou em frente ao computador ou com fones de ouvido, fico perfeitamente calmo."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:184
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_6145388b:

#   a "It's my safe space."
    a "É o meu refúgio."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:186
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_c85442be:

#   mc "But what about when we went to the security warehouse together?"
    mc "Mas e quando fomos juntos ao depósito de segurança?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:188
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_5dbcde57:

#   mc "You seemed pretty calm that day."
    mc "Você parecia bastante calmo naquele dia."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:190
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_3eee90a8:

#   a "Yeah, I was..."
    a "Sim, eu estava..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:192
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_8fe5baf1:

#   a "I think that's because you were there with me and I was more comfortable with those surroundings for the most part."
    a "Acho que isso aconteceu porque você estava lá comigo e eu me senti mais confortável naquele ambiente na maior parte do tempo."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:194
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_7eb13ffc:

#   a "And I'd prepared pretty well for that."
    a "E eu me preparei muito bem para isso."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:196
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_5166415b:

#   mc "So being in here, in a cafe with only a few other people..."
    mc "Então, estar aqui, em um café com apenas algumas outras pessoas..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:198
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_be7c1a11:

#   mc "How does that make you feel?"
    mc "Como isso te faz sentir?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:200
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_8fca10f9:

#   a "Anxious as all hell."
    a "Ansioso ao extremo."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:202
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_b1b2813e:

#   a "I've never set foot in here before."
    a "Nunca pus os pés aqui antes."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:203
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_72621435:

#   a "You sprung it on me and when that happens, I start to overthink everything."
    a "Você me pegou de surpresa e, quando isso acontece, eu começo a pensar demais em tudo."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:205
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_c6ecf3ce:

#   mc "Well, just being here is a start."
    mc "Bom, só o fato de estar aqui já é um começo."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:207
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_8fea2db2:

#   mc "Hmm..."
    mc "Hum..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:208
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_51cfeb61:

#   mc "Okay, I'm going to help you."
    mc "Certo, vou te ajudar."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:210
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_2813e28f:

#   a "What do you mean?"
    a "O que você quer dizer?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:213
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_a3c18ec7:

#   mc "So I've been thinking it over."
    mc "Então, estive pensando sobre isso."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:215
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_a8f2464c:

#   mc "It seems like a social anxiety disorder. You have a social phobia."
    mc "Parece ser um transtorno de ansiedade social. Você tem fobia social."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:216
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_d61846ec:

#   mc "It's not incurable, you just need to take things one step at a time."
    mc "Não é incurável, você só precisa ir um passo de cada vez."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:218
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_adf2f5ae:

#   a "And you're going to help me?"
    a "E você vai me ajudar?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_04_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel.rpy:220
translate brazil lb_ep01_Bonus_Scene_Date_with_Ariel1_a72b5576:

#   mc "Yeah, of course. You have nothing to fear, [a_name]."
    mc "Sim, claro. Você não tem nada a temer. [a_name]."

